<title>UK: BT to slash cost of calls to mobile phones.</title>
<headline>BT to slash cost of calls to mobile phones.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Wednesday that it would cut the cost of calls to the Cellnet and Vodafone mobile phone networks by up to 11.7 percent.</p>
</text>
